// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — Level 3 (2001–3000字) Unit 14
window.T14_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"awful – dragonfly","cards":[{"w":"awful","p":"adj.","d":"extremely bad, unpleasant, or shocking","c":"極糟糕的；可怕的","s":"We had to cancel our family picnic in the park because of the awful weather.","t":"因為極糟糕的天氣，我們不得不取消在公園的家庭野餐。"},{"w":"bulb","p":"n.","d":"a glass electric light; an underground plant stem","c":"電燈泡；植物鱗莖（球根）","s":"The bright light bulb in the hallway suddenly burned out and plunged the floor into darkness.","t":"走廊上明亮的電燈泡突然燒壞，使整個樓層陷入黑暗。"},{"w":"bull","p":"n.","d":"an uncastrated adult male animal of cattle; a large strong beast","c":"公牛；雄性大型動物","s":"The brave matador waved a bright red cloth to divert the charging wild bull.","t":"勇敢的鬥牛士揮舞鮮紅的布以轉移那隻衝鋒的野公牛的注意。"},{"w":"career","p":"n.","d":"an occupation or profession followed for a significant period of life","c":"職業生涯；事業","s":"After graduating from college, Emily chose to pursue a rewarding career in medicine.","t":"大學畢業後，艾蜜莉選擇追求一份有意義的醫學職業生涯。"},{"w":"conscious","p":"adj.","d":"aware of and responding to one's surroundings; awake","c":"清醒的；意識到的；有知覺的","s":"The injured driver remained fully conscious while emergency rescue workers lifted him from the vehicle.","t":"當緊急救援人員將受傷駕駛從車內救出時，他依然保持完全清醒。"},{"w":"unconscious","p":"adj.","d":"not awake and aware of and responding to one's environment","c":"失去知覺的；昏迷的","s":"The boxer delivered a powerful punch that knocked his opponent completely unconscious onto the canvas.","t":"拳擊手打出了一記重拳，將對手徹底擊昏迷失去知覺在擂台上。"},{"w":"consciousness","p":"n.","d":"the state of being awake and aware of one's surroundings","c":"知覺；意識（不可數）","s":"The feverish patient began to lose consciousness and had to be rushed into the emergency room.","t":"發高燒的病人開始失去意識知覺，必須緊急送往急診室。"},{"w":"cough","p":"n.","d":"an act or sound of expelling air from the lungs abruptly","c":"咳嗽（名詞）","s":"Drinking warm honey water can help soothe a painful throat and relieve a dry cough.","t":"喝溫蜂蜜水有助於舒緩喉嚨疼痛並緩解乾咳。"},{"w":"cough","p":"v.","d":"to expel air from the lungs with a sudden sharp sound","c":"咳嗽（動詞）","s":"Remember to cover your mouth with your elbow whenever you cough in crowded public spaces.","t":"在擁擠的公共場所咳嗽時，記得用手肘掩住嘴巴。"},{"w":"crown","p":"n.","d":"a circular ornamental headdress worn by a monarch as a symbol of power","c":"皇冠；王冠","s":"Sparkling diamonds, rubies, and sapphires were set into the royal queen's golden crown.","t":"閃閃發光的鑽石、紅寶石和藍寶石鑲嵌在皇家女王的黃金皇冠上。"},{"w":"crown","p":"v.","d":"to place a crown on the head of someone to make them monarch","c":"為…加冕；立…為王（動詞）","s":"The young prince was officially crowned king before thousands of cheering citizens at the cathedral.","t":"年輕的王子在大教堂數千名歡呼的市民面前正式被加冕為國王。"},{"w":"dragonfly","p":"n.","d":"a fast-flying insect with two pairs of large transparent wings","c":"蜻蜓（可數）","s":"A bright blue dragonfly hovered gracefully above the quiet pond before landing on a water lily.","t":"一隻明亮的藍色蜻蜓在安靜的池塘上方優雅盤旋，隨後停在一朵睡蓮上。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"excellence – investigation","cards":[{"w":"excellence","p":"n.","d":"the quality of being outstanding or extremely good","c":"卓越；傑出；優秀（不可數）","s":"The world-famous French restaurant constantly aims for culinary excellence in every delicate dish it serves.","t":"這家世界著名的法國餐廳在提供的每道精緻菜餚中持續追求烹飪的卓越。"},{"w":"excellent","p":"adj.","d":"extremely good; of the highest quality","c":"極好的；優秀的；傑出的","s":"After ten years of careful maintenance, my grandfather's vintage car remains in excellent condition.","t":"經過十年的悉心保養，我祖父的古董車依然保持在極好的狀態。"},{"w":"flash","p":"v.","d":"to shine with a sudden bright light, or to move very quickly","c":"閃爍；閃光；掠過（動詞）","s":"A jagged bolt of white lightning flashed across the stormy night sky before thunder shook the hills.","t":"在雷聲震動山丘之前，一道鋸齒狀的白色閃電在暴風雨的夜空中閃過。"},{"w":"flash","p":"n.","d":"a sudden brief burst of bright light or a very short time","c":"閃光；一瞬間（名詞）","s":"The bright flash from the tourist's camera startled the shy kitten resting beneath the garden bench.","t":"遊客相機發出的明亮閃光驚嚇到了花園長椅下休息的害羞小貓。"},{"w":"flashy","p":"adj.","d":"ostentatiously attractive or bright in a cheap or vulgar way","c":"炫目的；俗麗招搖的","s":"The wealthy lottery winner loved driving his bright orange and flashy sports car around the quiet town.","t":"那位富有的樂透得主喜歡開著他亮橘色且招搖炫目的跑車在安靜的小鎮周圍兜風。"},{"w":"flashlight","p":"n.","d":"a portable battery-powered electric lamp","c":"手電筒（可數）","s":"When the city power grid suddenly failed during the blizzard, dad used a bright flashlight to guide us downstairs.","t":"當暴風雪期間城市電網突然斷電時，爸爸用一支明亮的手電筒引導我們下樓。"},{"w":"global","p":"adj.","d":"relating to the whole world; worldwide","c":"全球的；全世界的","s":"Scientists around the world emphasize that combatting global warming requires strong international cooperation.","t":"世界各地的科學家強調，對抗全球暖化需要強有力的國際合作。"},{"w":"globe","p":"n.","d":"the earth, or a spherical model of the earth","c":"地球；地球儀（可數）","s":"Millions of passionate soccer fans across the globe tuned in live to watch the World Cup final.","t":"全球各地數百萬熱情的足球迷在線上即時收看世界盃決賽。"},{"w":"grab","p":"v.","d":"to take hold of something suddenly and roughly; to obtain quickly","c":"抓取；趕緊吃／拿（動詞）","s":"Let's grab a quick bite at the nearby diner before the evening movie screening begins.","t":"在傍晚電影放映開始之前，我們去附近的餐館隨便吃點東西吧。"},{"w":"handful","p":"n.","d":"a small number of people or things, or a quantity that fills the hand","c":"一把；少數幾個人事物；棘手難管的人","s":"The kind little girl scattered a generous handful of sunflower seeds on the ground for the wild birds.","t":"那位善良的小女孩在地上撒了滿滿一把葵花籽餵野生鳥兒。"},{"w":"honor","p":"n.","d":"high respect, esteem, or a privilege that brings pride","c":"榮譽；光榮；敬意（不可數/可數）","s":"The university hosted a formal graduation dinner in honor of the visiting foreign scholars.","t":"大學舉辦了正式的畢業晚宴，以向…表達敬意到訪的外國學者。"},{"w":"honor","p":"v.","d":"to regard with great respect, or to fulfill a promise or agreement","c":"表彰；兌現（承諾）；向…致敬","s":"A trustworthy company will always honor its warranty promises and provide free repairs to customers.","t":"一家值得信賴的公司總是會履行兌現其保固承諾，並為顧客提供免費維修。"},{"w":"humor","p":"n.","d":"the quality of being amusing or comical, or an appreciative mood","c":"幽默；幽默感（不可數）","s":"Mr. Davies is widely loved by his high school students because he possesses a wonderful sense of humor.","t":"戴維斯先生深受他的高中學生喜愛，因為他擁有絕佳的幽默感。"},{"w":"humorous","p":"adj.","d":"causing laughter and amusement; funny","c":"幽默的；詼諧風趣的","s":"Uncle Bob entertained the excited children all evening by recounting humorous stories about his travels.","t":"鮑伯叔叔整晚藉由講述他旅行中的幽默風趣故事逗得孩子們很開心。"},{"w":"investigate","p":"v.","d":"to carry out a systematic or formal inquiry to discover the truth","c":"調查；偵查；審查（動詞）","s":"The police assigned two experienced senior detectives to thoroughly investigate the armed bank robbery.","t":"警方指派了兩位經驗豐富的資深刑警來徹底調查該起武裝銀行搶案。"},{"w":"investigation","p":"n.","d":"a formal inquiry or systematic examination of facts","c":"調查；調查研究（可數/不可數）","s":"The city authorities promised to launch an immediate investigation into the causes of the building collapse.","t":"市府當局承諾對大樓倒塌的原因立即展開調查。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"invitation – palm","cards":[{"w":"invitation","p":"n.","d":"a written or spoken request inviting someone to attend an event","c":"邀請；邀請卡（可數/不可數）","s":"We were delighted to receive an elegant wedding invitation to our cousin's banquet next month.","t":"我們很高興收到下個月表哥婚宴的優雅婚禮喜帖／邀請。"},{"w":"invite","p":"v.","d":"to ask someone politely to go somewhere or do something","c":"邀請；招致（動詞）","s":"Our generous new neighbors decided to invite all the families on our street over for dinner.","t":"我們慷慨的新鄰居決定邀請我們整條街的所有家庭來家裡共進晚餐。"},{"w":"lightning","p":"n.","d":"the naturally occurring electrostatic discharge produced during a thunderstorm","c":"閃電（不可數）","s":"A blinding bolt of lightning split the pitch-black sky just seconds before a deafening boom of thunder.","t":"一道耀眼的閃電撕裂漆黑的夜空，幾秒鐘後傳來震耳欲聾的雷聲。"},{"w":"medal","p":"n.","d":"a metal disc awarded as a distinction for bravery or sporting success","c":"獎牌；勳章（可數）","s":"After four years of grueling training, the swimmer was overjoyed to win a gold medal at the Olympics.","t":"經過四年艱苦的訓練，那位游泳選手在奧運會上欣喜若狂地贏得了一枚金牌。"},{"w":"miracle","p":"n.","d":"an extraordinary and welcome event attributed to a divine agency or extreme luck","c":"奇蹟；不可思議的事（可數）","s":"It was considered an absolute miracle that all passengers survived the plane crash without any serious injuries.","t":"所有乘客都在飛機失事中生還且未受重傷，這被視為一場名副其實的奇蹟。"},{"w":"miraculous","p":"adj.","d":"occurring through divine intervention or bringing wonderful fortune","c":"奇蹟般的；不可思議的","s":"The elderly grandfather made a miraculous recovery after the complicated twelve-hour heart surgery.","t":"年邁的祖父在歷經十二個小時的複雜心臟手術後，實現了奇蹟般的康復。"},{"w":"missile","p":"n.","d":"a weapon or rocket directed by remote control or automatically guided","c":"飛彈；導彈（可數）","s":"The modern military warship is equipped with an advanced missile defense system to protect naval fleets.","t":"這艘現代軍事戰艦配備了先進的飛彈防禦系統，以保護海軍艦隊。"},{"w":"motel","p":"n.","d":"a roadside hotel designed primarily for motorists, typically with parking outside rooms","c":"汽車旅館（可數）","s":"Exhausted from twelve hours of driving across the desert, we checked into a cheap roadside motel for the night.","t":"開車穿越沙漠十二個小時而精疲力竭後，我們當晚入住了一家便宜的路邊汽車旅館。"},{"w":"necktie","p":"n.","d":"a long piece of cloth worn around the neck and tied in a knot at the front","c":"領帶（可數）","s":"For his high-level job interview at the corporate bank, Alan wore a tailored navy suit and a striped necktie.","t":"為了他在商業銀行的重大工作面試，艾倫穿了一套量身訂製的深藍色西裝並繫了條條紋領帶。"},{"w":"palm","p":"n.","d":"the inner surface of the hand; an unbranched tropical tree with a crown of large leaves","c":"手掌；棕櫚樹（可數）","s":"The charming storyteller spoke with such captivating charisma that he held the entire audience in the palm of his hand.","t":"那位充滿魅力的說書人演講極具吸引力，將全場觀眾牢牢掌握在自己的手掌心／股掌之中。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"plug – stormy","cards":[{"w":"plug","p":"n.","d":"an electrical connector inserted into a socket; a rubber stopper for a sink or bathtub","c":"插頭；塞子（可數）","s":"Be sure to hold the plastic base firmly rather than yanking the wire when pulling the plug from the wall.","t":"從牆上拔出插頭時，務必牢牢握住塑膠底座，而不是猛拉電線。"},{"w":"plug","p":"v.","d":"to insert an electrical plug into a socket; to block an opening","c":"插入插頭；堵塞；推銷（動詞）","s":"I need to find an empty electrical outlet to plug in my laptop before the battery completely dies.","t":"在電池完全沒電之前，我需要找到一個空的電源插座來插上我的筆記型電腦。"},{"w":"recognize","p":"v.","d":"to identify someone or something from previous encounter or knowledge","c":"認出；承認；表彰（動詞）","s":"Although thirty years had passed since graduation, David easily recognized his high school classmate in the crowd.","t":"儘管畢業後已經過了三十年，大衛仍在人群中輕易認出了他的高中同學。"},{"w":"recognition","p":"n.","d":"identification of a person or thing; appreciation or acclaim","c":"認出；認可；讚譽（不可數）","s":"After the massive storm swept through the town, the historic seaside streets were damaged beyond recognition.","t":"在猛烈的暴風雨橫掃小鎮之後，歷史悠久的海濱街道受損嚴重至無法辨認／面目全非。"},{"w":"remain","p":"v.","d":"to continue to exist, or stay in the same condition or place","c":"保持；依然存在；留下（動詞）","s":"Flight attendants gently reminded all passengers to remain seated with their seatbelts fastened until the plane stopped.","t":"空服員親切地提醒所有乘客保持就坐並繫緊安全帶，直到飛機完全停穩。"},{"w":"robe","p":"n.","d":"a loose outer garment reaching to the ankles, worn for warmth or ceremonies","c":"長袍；浴袍；禮袍（可數）","s":"After stepping out of the steamy shower on a freezing winter evening, Martha put on a warm, fluffy robe.","t":"在寒冷的冬日夜晚走出冒著熱氣的淋浴間後，瑪莎穿上了一件保暖且柔軟的浴袍。"},{"w":"sincere","p":"adj.","d":"free from pretense or deceit; proceeding from genuine feelings","c":"真誠的；由衷的","s":"When the young clerk realized his clerical mistake, he offered a deeply sincere apology to the customer.","t":"當那位年輕店員意識到自己的文書錯誤時，他向顧客表達了深深的真誠歉意。"},{"w":"snap","p":"v.","d":"to break suddenly with a sharp crack; to take a quick photo","c":"突然折斷；拍照；猛咬（動詞）","s":"The heavy weight of the winter snow caused several dry tree branches to snap loudly in half.","t":"冬雪的沉重重量導致幾根乾枯的樹枝發出清脆的聲響並折成兩半。"},{"w":"stomach","p":"n.","d":"the internal organ in which the major part of food digestion occurs","c":"胃；腹部（可數）","s":"Doctors advise that you should avoid drinking strong black coffee on an entirely empty stomach.","t":"醫生建議你應該避免在完全空腹／胃的情況下飲用濃黑咖啡。"},{"w":"stormy","p":"adj.","d":"characterized by violent weather with strong winds, rain, or thunder","c":"暴風雨的；激烈的；動盪的","s":"The fishing harbor prohibited all small wooden boats from departing due to the dangerous stormy weather.","t":"由於危險的暴風雨天氣，漁港禁止所有小型木船出海。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"summit – vitamin","cards":[{"w":"summit","p":"n.","d":"the highest point of a hill or mountain; a high-level meeting of heads of government","c":"山頂；頂峰；高峰會議（可數）","s":"After ten hours of strenuous climbing across ice and rock, the mountaineers finally reached the snow-covered summit.","t":"在穿越冰層與岩石歷經十個小時的艱苦攀登後，登山隊員們終於登上了白雪覆蓋的山頂。"},{"w":"swift","p":"adj.","d":"happening quickly or moving with great speed","c":"迅速的；敏捷的；快速的","s":"The customer service department earned high praise from clients for its remarkably swift response to inquiries.","t":"客戶服務部門因對詢問做出非常迅速的回應而贏得客戶的高度讚賞。"},{"w":"swiftly","p":"adv.","d":"at high speed; quickly and smoothly","c":"迅速地；敏捷地","s":"The agile deer moved swiftly through the dense forest whenever it heard the distant snap of twigs.","t":"每當聽到遠處樹枝折斷的聲音，敏捷的鹿就會在茂密的森林中迅速地穿梭。"},{"w":"tablet","p":"n.","d":"a small flat compressed medicine disc; a portable touchscreen computer; an inscribed flat slab","c":"藥片；平板電腦；刻寫石板（可數）","s":"The family doctor advised grandma to take one calcium tablet with a glass of warm water every morning.","t":"家庭醫生建議祖母每天早晨配上一杯溫水吞服一顆鈣片。"},{"w":"tease","p":"v.","d":"to make fun of someone playfully or unkindly","c":"嘲弄；取笑；戲弄（動詞）","s":"Older boys at the playground would often tease little Kevin about his oversized glasses until he cried.","t":"操場上的大男孩們常因小凱文戴著過大的眼鏡而取笑他，直到他哭了出來。"},{"w":"trumpet","p":"n.","d":"a brass musical wind instrument with a flared bell and valves","c":"小號；喇叭（可數）","s":"An accomplished jazz musician stepped onto the stage and played the brass trumpet with brilliant skill.","t":"一位造詣高超的爵士樂手走上舞台，技巧精湛地吹奏黃銅小號。"},{"w":"tub","p":"n.","d":"a wide, open, deep, typically round container used for holding liquids or goods","c":"浴缸；桶；盆（可數）","s":"After a grueling day of physical labor, soaking in a warm tub full of fragrant bubbles eased all my muscle aches.","t":"經過一整天繁重的體力勞動後，泡在裝滿芬芳泡沫的溫暖浴缸裡緩解了我所有的肌肉痠痛。"},{"w":"vitamin","p":"n.","d":"an organic compound essential in small quantities to maintain normal metabolism and health","c":"維他命；維生素（可數）","s":"Fresh citrus fruits such as oranges and grapefruits are naturally rich in vitamin C, which strengthens immune defense.","t":"新鮮柑橘類水果（例如柳橙和葡萄柚）天然富含維他命C，有助於增強免疫防禦。"}]}];
